 {
  "text": "Good afternoon. This is the restaurant on the corner. Your table for six is ready at twelve thirty. Today the plate of the day is fish with rice, and there is a vegetarian option too. Would you like coffee after lunch? Please tell us when you arrive. See you soon.",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a10_listening1.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "In my country we do not wait for the bill. We go to the counter and we pay there. Here it is different: you sit, you wait, and the waiter brings the bill to the table. In my first week I always stood up too early. Now I know what to do. I say: can I have the bill, please? And I wait.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a10_listening2.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Giovanna arrives at the restaurant with the London team. The waiter shows them the table. She reads the menu in English. She orders fish and a coffee. At the end she asks for the bill.",
